{"3923060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PLA-TOON 2", "steam_appid": 3923060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players start in a lobby where they vote on what level and game mode to play. After the round ends, they return to the lobby. Game modes include Arena, Base Defense, Battle Royale, Deathmatch, and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is highly destructible, and buildings can be damaged and destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a jeep and a biplane, and soon, tanks and rideable ostriches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some interesting items, including jetpacks and potions that make your player a giant for a short amount of time, allowing them to pick up other players, vehicles, and easily destroy buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can dive/flip and can be knocked over by attacks and explosions; they can knock weapons out of each other's hands, leading to chaotic struggles between players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have an ambitious list of features I'd still like to add. I'm  solo developing this game a few hours each day  after my day job as a full-stack developer. I've been making games as a hobby for close to 10 years now.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players start in a lobby where they vote on what level and game mode to play. After the round ends, they return to the lobby. Game modes include Arena, Base Defense, Battle Royale, Deathmatch, and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environment is highly destructible, and buildings can be damaged and destroyed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a jeep and a biplane, and soon, tanks and rideable ostriches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some interesting items, including jetpacks and potions that make your player a giant for a short amount of time, allowing them to pick up other players, vehicles, and easily destroy buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can dive/flip and can be knocked over by attacks and explosions; they can knock weapons out of each other's hands, leading to chaotic struggles between players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have an ambitious list of features I'd still like to add. I'm  solo developing this game a few hours each day  after my day job as a full-stack developer. I've been making games as a hobby for close to 10 years now.</p>", "short_description": "A chaotic, stylized, light-hearted, whimsical, cartoon party-style shooter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923060/0a3494562ca62fd5dfbde72a646973171c02194d/header.jpg?t=1756947985", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923060/714a3786a236f8e78acda075666e32871aef2ef9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756947985", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923060/714a3786a236f8e78acda075666e32871aef2ef9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756947985", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</s